			"notes": "增加了**元素系统**\n\n解锁魔法后自动解锁元素系统，当身体为水元素攻击后切换成火元素攻击会自动打出蒸发伤害，火元素可使攻击方着火，其余元素还在开发中\n\n**使用方法** 将烈焰粉、潮涌核心、泥土、羽毛、伤害魔法棒、漂浮魔法棒扔入一个方块中即可合成元素法杖，可切换当前元素\n\n> _元素还处于测试版本中，不代表最终品质_\n\n更新依赖Minecraft版本为**1.21.11**\n\nAdded **Element System**\n\nThe element system is automatically unlocked after unlocking magic. When your body is a water element and you switch to a fire element attack, it will automatically deal vaporize damage. Fire element can set the attacker on fire, and other elements are still in development.\n\n**How to use**: Throw Flame Powder, Tidal Core, Earth, Feather, Damage Magic Wand, and Floating Magic Wand into a single block to craft an Element Wand, which can switch the current element.\n\n> _Elements are still in a test version and do not represent the final quality_\n\nUpdate requires Minecraft version **1.21.11**"
		},
