			"notes": "## 修改\n再次修改指引书，更进一步的体验，支持显示配方\n优化魔法阵粒子效果，同时优化代码逻辑，流畅更多666\n## 新增\n### 新增了上个版本的魔法阵，现在他是**传送魔法阵**\n\n```\n右键地面建造一个传送魔法阵\n右键基座可以收回\nF7按键可以传送回魔法阵基座\n配方：红石 末影珍珠 红石\n红石 魔法之星 红石\n红石 末影珍珠 红石\n```\n\n<details>\n<summary>More</summary>\n\n后面我们会更新更多关于此类功能，以及优化魔法阵\n\n</details>\n\n## Modifications\nFurther revised the guidebook for an enhanced experience, now supporting recipe display.\nOptimized the magic circle particle effects, while also improving the code logic, making it smoother 666.\n## New Features\n### Added the magic circle from the previous version, now it's a **Teleportation Magic Circle**\n\n```\nRight-click on the ground to build a teleportation magic circle\nRight-click the base to retract it\nPress F7 to teleport back to the magic circle base\nRecipe: Redstone Ender Pearl Redstone\nRedstone Star of Magic Redstone\nRedstone Ender Pearl Redstone\n```\n\n<details>\n<summary>More</summary>\n\nWe will later update more features related to this, as well as further optimize the magic circle.\n\n</details>"
		},
