			"notes": "## 0.0.5\n### 中文\n- 升级Minecraft版本1.21.7\n- 增加附魔书的获取方式\n\n> 将红石/力量药水扔在一格方块内即可合成\n> \n> 红石+书 = 蓄能附魔\n> \n> 力量药水+书 = 伤能附魔\n\n\n- 修复已知问题\n\n### English\n- Upgrade Minecraft to version 1.21.7\n- Add new ways to obtain enchanted books\n\n> Throw Redstone/Strength Potion into a block space to craft\n> \n> Redstone Book = Power Storage Enchantment\n> \n> Strength Potion Book = Damage Enchantment\n \n- Fixed known issues"
		},
